Goal:
- initialize `pocket-copilot/` in the current repository
- create only missing directories and files
- never overwrite existing files
- prefill `rules/project-context.md` and base rule files from repository evidence when possible
- keep unknown items explicitly marked as `待补充`
- end with `created / skipped / needs-manual-review`
